            <div class="hero-right">
                <p class="hero-sub">From the first prompt to the final diff, Holt keeps your work moving—and keeps you in control.</p>
                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a class="btn btn-dk" href="/download">Download Holt <span class="icon icon-download" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
                    <a class="btn btn-wh" href="https://github.com/Onion-L/holt">GitHub <span class="icon icon-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
                </div>
