        <div class="section">
            <!-- WHY -->
            <div class="why" id="why">
                <h2>Less babysitting.<br />More building.</h2>
            </div>

            <!-- FEATURES -->
            <div class="features">
                <div class="fc wide">
                    <div class="fv">Product screenshot</div>
                    <div class="fb">
                        <div class="fn">SYS / 01</div>
                        <h3>Bring your<br />own keys.</h3>
                        <p>Choose the model that fits the task. Connect major providers or define your own, change course mid-chat, and keep your credentials local.</p>
                        <div class="tags">
                            <span class="tag">Custom providers</span>
                            <span class="tag">Live model settings</span>
                            <span class="tag">Local credentials</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="fc">
                    <div class="fv">Product screenshot</div>
                    <div class="fb">
                        <div class="fn">SYS / 02</div>
                        <h3>Continue,<br />don't restart.</h3>
                        <p>Conversations and checkpoints survive interruption. When Holt comes back, your work comes back with it.</p>
                        <div class="tags">
                            <span class="tag">Crash recovery</span>
                            <span class="tag">Step checkpoints</span>
                            <span class="tag">Rewind changes</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="fc">
                    <div class="fv">Product screenshot</div>
                    <div class="fb">
                        <div class="fn">SYS / 03</div>
                        <h3>Put a crew<br />on it.</h3>
                        <p>Coordinate focused subagents across a declared plan. Watch each branch move and keep the main conversation clear.</p>
                        <div class="tags">
                            <span class="tag">Parallel agents</span>
                            <span class="tag">Visible plans</span>
                            <span class="tag">Resumable results</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- CTA -->
            <div class="cta">
                <h2>Give your next idea<br />some room to run.</h2>
                <div class="cta-actions">
                    <a class="btn btn-wh" href="/download">Download for free <span class="icon icon-download" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
                    <a class="btn btn-gh" href="https://github.com/Onion-L/holt">GitHub <span class="icon icon-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
