            <footer>
                <span>© 2026 Holt · GPL-3.0 · macOS / Windows / Linux · v<span data-version>x.x.x</span></span>
                <div class="fl">
                    <a href="/changelog">Changelog</a>
                    <a href="https://github.com/Onion-L/holt">Source</a>
                </div>
            </footer>
